    "prompt": {
      "description": "A flame-tender who keeps the fire fed. A peaked metal hood with a pointed cap and a deep shadowed face cavity, only a small patch of face visible inside it, eyes as dark recesses. A heavy metal apron and thick gauntlets. Held level at chest height in both hands, a squat iron firepot with a hard rim on every side; inside it a small bright core of burning fuel, boxed in by the rim on all four sides and never spilling past it. A bundle of fuel staves slung low on one side breaks the outline. Squat and wide-footed.",
      "must_include": [
        "a peaked metal hood with a pointed cap and a deep shadowed face cavity",
        "a squat iron firepot held level at chest height in both hands",
        "a hard rim enclosing the firepot on all four sides",
        "a small bright burning core inside the pot, fully boxed in by the rim, at chest height and never above the head",
        "a bundle of fuel staves slung low on one side, breaking the body outline",
        "eyes as dark recesses inside the hood"
      ],
      "must_avoid": [
        "a lamp, lantern, torch or candle, and anything held up or held high",
